              "value": "No problem — we will not proceed with returning or retiring your laptop, and we won’t start the new laptop selection process. <br>If you change your mind, you can come back anytime to restart the request and I will help you choose a replacement tailored to your role. <br>You may close this chat window now. <br> {{$context.$nodes.DEEP_LINK_TO_SSP_HOME.$output}}"
            }
