        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize the conversation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771544822762"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_THE_CONVERSATION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771544822762",
          "id": "1771536013283",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771536013284_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given details from a chat between an employee and an AI support assistant about a laptop issue and replacement. \nWrite a professional summary the employee can read in their service request. Make the summary first-person as if speaking to the employee directly. Keep it under 1000 characters.\n\nInclude:\n- Who the employee is (name)\n- The employee’s original request/problem (from their input message)\n- What the assistant advised initially (warranty status + next step: ship back to retire/repair)\n- The outcome: which replacement laptop was selected, where it should be delivered, and the requested delivery date\n- A sentence stating the Requisition Number along with a clickable link to the purchase requisition of the new laptop - show this as is - make NO changes - {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_REQUISITION_DEEP_LINK_USING_LLM.$output.clickableLink}}\n- If present, reference the employee’s home and work addresses only as “home address on file” / “work address on file” (do not print full addresses)\n\nUse complete sentences, a neutral/helpful tone, and a short bullet list if it improves readability. Do not include internal variable names.\n\nEmployee name: {{$context.$nodes.GET_USER_SESSION.$output.items[0].DisplayName}}\nEmployee message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nAssistant’s initial response/context:\n{{$context.$nodes.LAPTOP_IMAGE_UPLOADED.$output}}\nBased on our records, the laptop is currently out of warranty. The assistant recommended shipping it back for retirement and offered help selecting a replacement.\n\nRequisition Number - {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_LAPTOP_REQUISITION.$output.Requisition}}\nReplacement selection:\nSelected laptop: {{$context.$variables.laptopSelected}}\nDelivery location preference: {{$context.$variables.deliveryAddress}}\nRequested delivery date: {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_DELIVERY_DATE.$output.result_date}}\n\nAs a strict rule, DO NOT append any characters like brackets or trailing Periods (.) at the end of valid URLs."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summarize Conversation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771579694980"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARIZE_CONVERSATION",
          "id": "1771572873312",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771572873314_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given details from a chat between an employee and an AI support assistant about a laptop issue and repair. \nWrite a professional summary the employee can read in their service request. Make the summary first-person, as if speaking directly to the employee. Keep it under 1000 characters.\n\nInclude:\n- Who the employee is (name)\n- The employee’s original request/problem (from their input message)\n- What the assistant advised initially (warranty status + next step: ship back to retire/repair)\n- The outcome: auto-assigned replacement laptop, where it should be delivered, and the requested delivery date\n- A sentence stating the Requisition Number along with a clickable link to the purchase requisition of the new laptop - show this as is - make NO changes - {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_REQUISITION_DEEP_LINK_USING_LLM.$output.clickableLink}}\n- If present, reference the employee’s home and work addresses only as “home address on file” / “work address on file” (do not print full addresses)\n\nUse complete sentences, a neutral/helpful tone, and a short bullet list if it improves readability. Do not include internal variable names.\n\nEmployee name: {{$context.$nodes.GET_USER_SESSION.$output.items[0].DisplayName}}\nEmployee message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nAssistant’s initial response/context:\n{{$context.$nodes.LAPTOP_IMAGE_UPLOADED.$output}}\nBased on our records, the laptop is currently in warranty. The assistant recommended shipping it back to maintenance for repairs and offered to create a requisition for a temporary laptop.\n\nRequisition Number - {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_LAPTOP_REQUISITION.$output.Requisition}}\nReplacement selection:\nAuto-assigned laptop: {{$context.$variables.laptopSelected}}\nDelivery location preference: {{$context.$variables.deliveryAddress}}\nRequested delivery date: {{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_DELIVERY_DATE.$output.result_date}}\n\nAs a strict rule, DO NOT append any characters like brackets or trailing Periods (.) at the end of valid URLs."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
