        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Available Laptops"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771505300741"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_AVAILABLE_LAPTOPS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772028904024",
          "id": "1770309769612",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770309769614_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA SOURCE\n- Read laptops from {{$context.$variables.availableNewAssignLaptops.items}}. Treat the array order as best-match priority. Only render the first three entries unless fewer exist.\n- Iterate through the array with a working variable such as `currentLaptop`. Insert the real values from that object—never echo raw paths like `$context.$variables.availableNewAssignLaptops.items[0].ItemDescription`.\n\nLAYOUT INSTRUCTIONS\n- Begin with the sentence: `Here are the most relevant laptops for your request. I have tagged the best match.` followed by two `<br>` tags and a wrapping `<div>`.\n- For each laptop output a `<table>` block with inline styles:\n  * `margin-bottom:5px;padding:15px;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #ddd;table-layout:auto;background-color:#fbf9f8`\n  * Within each table create a single row with two cells.\n- Left cell content:\n  * Line 1: `#<index>` (1-based) and, when `index === 1`, append a `<div>` badge reading `Best Match` using `display:inline-block;padding:2px 4px;background-color:#5F9EA0;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;border-radius:5px;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:10px`.\n  * Next line: Laptop description as a link if `itemLink` exists, otherwise plain text. Use the same anchor styling as the original (`color:rgb(0,104,140);text-decoration:none;`).\n  * Follow with detail rows rendered as `<span>` tags (font-size `0.75em`, display block, margin `0 0 2px 0`) for:\n    - Asset number (`AssetNumber`) if present.\n    - RAM capacity: parse `ItemDescription` and capture memory like `16GB` or `32 GB`; render as `RAM: 16GB`. Skip the line if no memory token is found.\n    - SSD/storage capacity: parse for `512GB`, `1TB`, etc.; render as `Storage: 512GB`. Skip if no storage term exists.\n    - Location (`OperatingOrganizationName` or `CurrentLocationName`) if available, prefixed with `Location:`.\n- Right cell content:\n  * Reserve a square `100px` box (`width:100px;height:100px;padding:2px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;`).\n  * If `thumbnailImage` exists and is not empty, place `<img src=\"...\">` with `style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:auto;\"`.\n  * Otherwise, render a neutral placeholder `<div>` with `style=\"width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;border:1px dashed #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;` and the text `Image coming soon`.\n\nFOOTER\n- After the loop, close the wrapping `<div>` and append instructions:\n  `Click <b>Approve</b> to select the best match and add it to the requisition.<br><br>Click <b>Request Change</b> to select other items.<br><br>`\n\nOUTPUT CONSTRAINTS\n- Return a single HTML string; no markdown fences, bullet lists, or commentary.\n- Preserve all inline styles exactly so the cards render consistently.\n- Do not invent data—pull strings directly from each laptop object and leave any missing fields blank.\n- Never output literal variable expressions (e.g., `$context...`); substitute the actual value or omit the line when a field is missing."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check If Selection Already Done Or Not Yet",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var result=\"\";\nif   ( !$context.$nodes.SELECTION_LAPTOP.$feedbackRecieved )\n{\n  result = \"Please click <b>Approve</b> to select the recommended laptop or <b>Request Change</b> to choose a different laptop.<br>\"\n}\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771946536380"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_IF_SELECTION_ALREADY_DONE_OR_NOT_YET",
